WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:08.520
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:15.030
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.860
It's my day!

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.440
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.850
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:42.220
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:49.630
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:55.400
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:02.540
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:10.050
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.190
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.260
I just want to walk

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.790
Not on tip-toe

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.760
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:35.670
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:42.110
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.380
It's my day!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:54.920
This is terrific!

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.560
I'm so glad you decided to
come to Atami!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:01:59.590
Me too.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:02.460
But are you sure it's okay
for us to use...

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.040
...your parents' villa?

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:08.640
Sure it is! We didn't have any special
plans this summer, anyhow.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:11.540
I know, but...

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.840
Boxed lunches!
Boxed lunches for sale!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:16.740
Excuse me!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.180
I'll have two boxed lunches!

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:19.580
And some tea, too!

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.450
Oh! And gimme a couple of beers!

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:25.020
What else... this one... and this one
too... <i>How much?!</i> 700 yen!

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:26.520
This usually costs only 300 yen!

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.920
This is too pricey!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:29.690
Can't we make a deal?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:34.470
I'm so sorry. My parents insisted
they come along!

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:38.260
No problem! The more the merrier.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.470
I guess the guys from Eitoku are
in Hawaii by now.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:46.770
Yeah...

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.950
<i>I wonder what Rui Hanazawa's doing...</i>

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.520
<i>Maybe he and Domyoji have
patched things up...</i>

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.520
<i>That's what's got me worried.</i>

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.460
Tsukushi?

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:08.730
You really wanted to go
to Hawaii?

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:10.700
No way! Not at all!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.100
I've always wanted to go to Atami.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:17.000
Its very much in vogue these days!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.870
Spending your summer
in Hawaii is lame!

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.540
Traveling overseas when you're
too young spoils you!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.180
Hawaii this... Hawaii that...

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.750
She seems pretty hung up on it, though...

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.190
Whew! It's so hot!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.260
What's with all the old folks?

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.540
There's nobody here my age!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.540
Dad! Mom!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:56.270
Why did you bring so much luggage?

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.180
This is a two-night, three-day trip!

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:00.220
We're not touring Europe, y'know!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:02.720
No?

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.720
Maybe I should've stayed home...

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:16.100
"Cinderella for a Night"

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.000
This is Kinomiya Shrine.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.700
They say it's dedicated to
the god of marriage.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.970
<i>M-Marriage?!</i>

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:32.950
Really? It's really pretty.
Let's go pay our respects!

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:42.790
<i>Please let my two-year sentence
at Eitoku fly by!</i>

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.120
<i>Please let Tsukushi realize
how much I like her!</i>

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.430
<i>Please let Tsukushi marry that
Domyoji boy and make us rich!</i>

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.760
<i>Oh, and please let my husband
get a promotion.</i>

00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:00.070
<i>Please make her give me
a bigger allowance. Please!</i>

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.840
Wow, it's the ocean!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:14.980
So many people!
Looks overwhelming...

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.450
Having fun, Tsukushi?

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:19.450
Uh-huh.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.160
I haven't felt this relaxed in ages!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:30.360
<i>Not since I entered Eitoku and
had to hide my feelings.</i>

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:43.010
<i>All those days of constant fighting
and pushing myself...</i>

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:52.790
<i>Compared to that, even this stifling wind feels refreshing...</i>

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.860
Look! That's my family's boat!

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.170
When it gets dark later,
let's go fishing for squid!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:12.510
Cool! What a gorgeous boat!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:16.740
Hurray for Atami! Hurray!

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.080
That's squid-tastic! Haw!

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.030
I guess they didn't get it...

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:27.320
Hey. Something's happening
on the beach.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.520
Wow...

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.520
What's that?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.940
That luxury yacht came out of nowhere!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.950
I wonder if it's some celebrity...

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.110
You wouldn't expect to find one
at a beach like this...

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:06.020
It's coming this way!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.290
There's someone standing
on the front deck.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:24.370
That silhouette...

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.820
I've seen it before...

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.450
What's <i>he</i> doing here?!

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.020
<i>I must be dreaming...</i>

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.340
<i>...because this is a nightmare!</i>

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:52.900
Yo! What're you doing
in this two-bit town?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.310
Are we there yet, Mr. Domyoji?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.910
<i>Argh! It's the F4 and Asai's gang!</i>

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.750
It's so hot!

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.680
Hey, it's Makino!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.590
Ew! What's she doing here?

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.090
You're kidding!

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:18.830
That's <i>my</i> line!
What happened to Hawaiil?

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:24.000
Who wants to go to
the same old place every year?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.990
The cool thing to do is go to
a hot springs resort, where kids don't go.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.690
The cool thing is
a hot springs resort?

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.930
Anyway, how do you like
my family yacht?

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.460
This is <i>your</i> yacht?!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:53.790
That's right.
But you'll never sail on it.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.870
Sir? Ma'am? Please, wake up!

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.570
Who wants to ride on
your dumb dinghy anyhow?!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.340
Oh!

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.310
What a small world!

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.520
I didn't know you were in Atami, too!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.790
<i>Shizuka Todo and Rui Hanazawa...</i>

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.390
What great timing!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.990
We're throwing a party
on board tonight.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:27.110
Why don't you join us?

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:39.140
Miss Shizuka!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:42.840
Don't you know what kind
of girl she is?

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.010
To invite someone
with her reputation...!

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.570
That's a rude thing to say.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:54.620
Besides, she probably doesn't
have anything formal to wear.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:55.450
Yeah!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.120
Then she can borrow
something of mine.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:02.810
Oh, that's all right... really...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:07.500
Please, come. The more the merrier.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.900
Right, Rui?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.740
Sure. Join us.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:03.190
But... we were going to go
squid fishing... right?

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:04.550
Squid?

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:06.360
What are you talking about?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.610
You're going to that party, Tsukushi!
No ifs, ands, or buts!

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.800
What on earth do you think we enrolled
you in Eitoku Academy for?!

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:15.930
If you don't go,
we'll kick you out of the house!

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:19.590
Please marry a rich man
so I can have a bigger allowance!

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:28.640
<i>For heaven's sake... my own parents...!</i>

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.580
Why's Rui inviting
her on board?!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:32.040
That should've been my line!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.620
Hey. Take it easy, Tsukasa!

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.220
Leggo!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.520
Come on. Let's get you ready!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:42.720
But I...

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.660
Don't be shy... come on.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.440
<i>This is getting kind of strange...</i>

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:03.340
Hurray!

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:08.350
Um... Hanazawa and Domyoji...

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.310
...have they made up?

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:13.620
Not yet.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:20.330
Tsukasa can be a real baby,
so we brought Rui along without asking.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:22.600
Really?

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:31.870
<i>Even though it meant his friendship
with Domyoji, Rui stood up for me...</i>

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.510
<i>But I shouldn't read
too much into it!</i>

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.980
<i>After all, Rui Hanazawa's got...</i>

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:47.250
My... your hair has got so much body!

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.320
I'm very jealous.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:51.620
Really?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:59.160
<i>Amazing! Compare the size of our faces.</i>

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:09.040
This is fun. I'm an only child, so I always 
wanted a little sister to play with.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:14.280
Rui and the boys are no fun
to dress up.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.250
<i>What gorgeous colors!</i>

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.850
<i>Who knew makeup could
smell so good?</i>

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.060
This dress should suit you.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:31.590
Everyone will be so surprised at
how stunning you'll look.

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:34.970
<i>She's so sweet.</i>

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:37.940
<i>I can't help but like her...</i>

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.840
<i>My heart's going a mile a minute...</i>

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:47.710
<i>I feel like I've been magically transformed into a princess!</i>

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.450
I can't believe that
just the other day...

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.920
I had garbage thrown in my face!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.230
Hey, hairdresser!

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:05.360
You'd better make my
 hair straight this time.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:11.570
I'll do my best, but your hair is
very curly and stubborn.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:14.470
I can keep it
straight for five hours, but...

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.140
Just shut up and do it.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:29.810
<i>Cinderella falls under the spell
and the party begins...</i>

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.790
<i>Cinderella for a night...</i>

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:54.670
Um... Shizuka... I don't know
if this is really me...

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.180
Why not? You look lovely.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.680
Come on. Let's go.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.360
We're here!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.310
Well? Doesn't she look wonderful?

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:33.310
Wow! That's that hick Tsukushi?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:34.810
She's cute!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.150
No way! That's not fair!

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:39.520
That's a Harriet Selling original!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.590
How could Shizuka put a dress
like that on her?

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:48.730
Makino's cute!
I thought she'd clean up pretty good!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.560
Shizuka knows what she's doing...

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.180
<i>Everyone's looking at me...</i>

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:10.120
<i>Like I'm a princess in a fairy tale...</i>

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:21.360
Tsukushi, you look great!
Really beautiful!

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.190
Thank you.

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:39.980
For just one night...

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:45.750
You look cute.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.150
Cinderella...

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:56.230
I guess clothes beat the band, huh?

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.360
<i>If you're gonna say that,
it's "clothes make the man"!</i>

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.600
<i>Now he's killed the mood...</i>

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.520
Domyoji. Let's dance!

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:27.490
Huh?

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:31.800
Okay.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.530
Come on Tsukushi! Let's dance!

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.730
I can't dance ballroom style...

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.700
Don't worry! I'll teach you!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:45.240
No thanks. But you 
go on and dance.

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.110
You sure?

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:28.840
<i>What a wonderful spell I'm under.</i>

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.580
<i>I hope it never ends!</i>

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:39.580
Ow!

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:42.990
Did I step on you?! I'm sorry!

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:44.690
I'm a fish out of water here...

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.520
...so I'm not used to this stuff...

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.280
<i>I'm such an idiot...</i>

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:15.620
<i>I should just be happy that even
I can be Cinderella for a night...</i>

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.920
What happened to the lights?

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:23.760
And now for our one-minute
special event!

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.400
Kissing in the Dark!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.370
Kiss anyone at all! Have fun!

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.670
Where's the F4?!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.940
Miss Shizuka! Where are you?

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.310
Who <i>are</i> you?!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:39.780
<i>What the...? 
Is this some kinda joke?</i>

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.760
<i>What was that?</i>

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.360
<i>Could that be... someone's lips?!</i>

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:16.520
<i>It can't be...!</i>

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:11.760
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:19.640
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:29.520
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:37.560
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:45.330
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:53.470
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:53.470
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.470 --> 00:23:01.850
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.470 --> 00:23:01.850
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:11.620
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:19.400
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:27.570
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:27.570
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:35.980
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:35.980
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:51.830
I knew that Rui Hanazawa was
in love with Shizuka.

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:53.730
But still...

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:56.800
each time I'd open the door to
the emergency staircase...

00:23:56.930 --> 00:23:58.530
my heart would pound.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:02.140
It was like going to see
my one precious treasure...

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:04.440
<i>Next on Hana Yori Dango:</i>

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.910
"Atami Night Love"

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:07.580
Don't hate me!
